## 🌟 Overview

The **Movie Recommender System** is an interactive web app that suggests movies similar to any title you search for. Type a movie name (or hit **Surprise Me** 🎲), and the engine returns a curated set of recommendations — complete with posters, titles, and release dates — rendered in a clean, dark-themed, hexagon-tiled gallery.

Under the hood, it combines two recommendation philosophies into one **hybrid engine**:

- 🧩 **Content-based filtering** — matches movies by genre, cast, crew, and keyword similarity
- 👥 **Collaborative filtering** — leans on patterns in how users historically rated/watched movies together

The result is a system that's smart from your first search (no "cold start" problem) *and* gets sharper recommendations by learning from collective viewing patterns.

